%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: AelasReturn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639185
    - rid: 268099682247639186
    - rid: 268099682247639188
    - rid: 268099682247639189
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: When working with Dwemer metal, you must heat the forge to be hotter
      than it would be when working with steel.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639190
    - rid: 268099682247639191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund uses the bellows mechanism to pump more air into the Skyforge.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Once it has heated up, you can begin the melting process.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund places all of the scrap that {mc} and Monika gave him into the
      forge.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not entire sure what sort of forging techniques the Dwarves used
      to accomplish this, but-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Most pieces of Dwemer scrap metal have hollow places within them, meaning
      that you'll get out less ingots than you would expect just from looking at
      it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So how many ingots should expect from all of this?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639192
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. I'd wager about twelve pieces.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639193
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Contrary to his prediction, the forge only bears eleven ingots.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639195
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: So, for a sword, we'll need one of these ingots...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: A steel ingot...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: An iron ingot...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: And a handful of leather strips for the bindings.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, what's the steel and iron for?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639197
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Two reasons, mostly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: First, when refined, Dwarven metal alone becomes excessively heavy, so
      alloying helps make it more ergonomic.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Second, the alloying helps make the metal more malleable for us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: This ingots weren't made for our methods of smithing, so we have to adapt
      it somewhat.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright. You want me to cut up some leather strips for you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: That'd be good. I'll introduce the ingots to the forge while you do that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639199
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki does as she said she would, slicing up some leather that they
      hand on hand into strips.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639200
    - rid: 268099682247639201
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: These good, Eorlund?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639202
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund gives Natsuki's work a glance over to see if it's good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639203
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye, those should do-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639204
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Shield-Sister. Aela's back.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639205
    - rid: 268099682247639207
    - rid: 268099682247639208
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Kodlak wants you to talk with us downstairs.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639209
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm leaving the strips by the shields, Eorlund.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639210
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course. Farewell, Shield-Sister.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639214
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639211
    - rid: 268099682247639212
    - rid: 268099682247639213
    - rid: 268099682247639215
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. We're all here. We can now begin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639216
    - rid: 268099682247639217
    - rid: 268099682247639221
    - rid: 268099682247639222
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela. What have you been doing while you were gone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Avenging Skjor, as justice demands.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: ... of course. However, the specifics that you are choosing not to mention
      are important.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: We were under the assumption that you were targetting Silver Hand leadership
      and murdering them. Is this true?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A brief period of awkward silence hangs in the air.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: ... how-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: How far did you go?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I've butchered the Silver Hand at the Valtheim Towers and Lost Knife
      Hideout.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639224
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: All in a day? Did you bring a Shield-Sibling?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I hunted alone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I was careful not to make the same mistake Skjor did; I avoided direct
      confrontation with groups if possible.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: If that's the case, why have you returned now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: The both of us know there are more than three Silver Hand sects in Skyrim,
      including the one you wiped out at Gallow's Rock.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: So why stop after two?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I was spotted after I took care of the leader at the Valtheim Towers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that bad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Shield-Sister, if they spotted Aela, that means they'll know a Companion
      was behind the killings-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639229
    - rid: 268099682247639230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: They'll believe we are intentionally escalating; trying to wipe them
      out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: If they think they're cornered, they'll lash out with the tenacity of
      the wounded animals they are.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's bad...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: This is why it is best not to let your passions control you; the long-term
      consequences can be dire.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639232
    - rid: 268099682247639234
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: No matter! We shall merely finish what I started and put them all to
      the sword!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela, everyone here knows that they have significantly more manpower
      than us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Your bold crusade is more foolish than noble.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: One of ours is worth twenty of theirs!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639235
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: If we were to just-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Suddenly, sounds of fight could be heard from upstairs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639236
    - rid: 268099682247639237
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That sounds way more intense than the stuff Athis and Njada get up too...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela, you <NoiseText=3,1>fool</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639238
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: To arms, Companions! We need to defend Jorrvaskr!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639239
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Everyone moves upstairs to join in the fight.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The five Companions encounter their fellows already locked in battle
      with hordes of Silver Hand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639240
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639244
    - rid: 268099682247639245
    - rid: 268099682247639242
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099682247639246
    - rid: 268099682247639247
    - rid: 268099682247639248
    - rid: 268099682247639249
    - rid: 268099682247639250
    - rid: 268099682247639251
